                "reply_count": 51,
                "retweet_count": 71,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "While I am still looking into all the issues in this reporting, I am well aware of Mike Beck\u2019s case and have worked directly to advocate for his care and support. His treatment at the hands of the government after serving the American people has been unacceptable. I can confirm that Mike has dealt with significant obstruction, as he has called out in the piece. I too have seen relentless obstruction from the federal government while I and others have tried to help him. I remain committed to seeing this through and uncovering the details of the IC\u2019s mishandling of Mike\u2019s case, as well as many others. I continue to directly address this with IC leadership, as my team did with NSA leadership regarding Mr. Beck as recently as a few weeks ago. Mike and many other victims deserve more than the treatment they have received from the federal government.",
